WEBVTT

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.175 --> 00:00:04.255
With a VaraaAi account, you can see your bookings again,

00:00:04.205 --> 00:00:07.230
cancel when something comes up, collect loyalty stamps,

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.510
and message your salon.

00:00:08.859 --> 00:00:12.030
Creating an account takes one minute, and it's completely free.

00:00:12.717 --> 00:00:16.771
On varaaai.com, tap Sign up, in the top right corner.

00:00:17.035 --> 00:00:21.878
On the page Create your account, enter your full name, email, phone number,

00:00:21.828 --> 00:00:24.371
a password, and the password once more.

00:00:24.708 --> 00:00:29.251
Below, choose whether you'd like to receive offers by email, or by text message.

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.171
Then tap Create account.

00:00:31.835 --> 00:00:35.578
Next time, tap Sign in, and enter your email and password.

00:00:35.923 --> 00:00:40.657
If you've forgotten your password, tap Forgot password, type your email,

00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:42.218
and tap Send reset link.

00:00:42.639 --> 00:00:45.978
Then open the email, and follow the steps to choose a new password.

00:00:46.612 --> 00:00:49.915
Once you're signed in, tap your name at the top to open the menu:

00:00:50.182 --> 00:00:55.915
My profile, My bookings, Loyalty cards, Inbox, Following, and Feed.

00:00:56.425 --> 00:01:00.715
In My profile, you can change your photo, your email and your password.

00:01:00.983 --> 00:01:01.515
That's it!

00:01:01.851 --> 00:01:02.955
Now take the quiz below.
